            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0625" n="614" xml:id="pg614"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.90H/40: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-01-12T13:00:00-05:00">January 12, 1938—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3. Personal for Engert from Murray. Your 131, December 27, 11 a.m. Since it now
                    seems impracticable for me to make my proposed trip to the Near East this
                    spring, I would suggest that you merely mention to the new Afghan Ambassador
                    that you hope to be able to visit Afghanistan sometime this year. Letter
                    follows. [Murray.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
